94=>['褻瀆之池','湧泉魔法： Exploit nearest corpse or sacrifice 66% health to create a Well of the Profane at its location. For 8...20 seconds, foes in that area are stripped of all enchantments and cannot be the target of further enchantments. (50% failure chance with Death Magic 4 or less.)','湧泉魔法： (8...20 seconds.) Foes in this well lose all enchantments and cannot be the target of further enchantments. Exploits a fresh corpse or sacrifices 66% health. 50% failure chance unless Death Magic 5 or more.'],
